class FeatureFlags:
    """Feature flags resolved once from APP_FLAG_* environment variables.

    Flags used to be read from a JSON file next to the executable, and the
    environment prefix was added so container deployments could toggle
    behavior without rebuilding the image. Names are lowercased, so
