class InvoiceRounder:
    """Quantize invoice line amounts to a fixed number of places.

    Earlier versions set getcontext().prec globally, which leaked into unrelated reports running in the same thread. Rounding now happens inside a local context with precision 40, because quantize raises InvalidOperation when the result needs more digits than the active precision allows.
